<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-16579] Cluster deactivation can get stuck</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-16579</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Cluster deactivation that is executed via Java API or control utility without --force flag can get stuck in the case when the cluster contains persistent caches and client nodes that do not provide DataStorageConfiguration. In that case, client nodes can erroneously consider that all caches are in-memory and therefore will not start the corresponding exchange process at all, unlike server nodes.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
